.TH WEFT-CLI 1 "2026-11-10" "weft 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
weft-cli \- Weft server, migration runner, scheduler and task CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B weft-cli
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B weft-cli
is the single Loco application binary shipped by the
.B weft
package. The package installs its runtime resources (themes and i18n files)
under
.I /usr/share/weft
and configuration under
.I /etc/weft
.
.PP
The systemd units invoke it as:
.PP
.RS
.B weft-cli start --server-and-worker --no-banner
.RE
.PP
for the web process, and
.PP
.RS
.B weft-cli scheduler --config /etc/weft/scheduler.yaml
.RE
.PP
for the scheduler process.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B start
Start the HTTP server. Add
.B --server-and-worker
to process background jobs in the same process.
.TP
.B db migrate
Apply pending database migrations. Reads
.I LOCO_ENV
and
.I LOCO_CONFIG_FOLDER
from the environment; the packaged units use
.I production
and
.I /etc/weft
.
.TP
.B task \fINAME\fR [KEY:VALUE ...]
Run an application task, for example
.B admin:create
or
.BR db:backup .
.TP
.B scheduler --config \fIPATH\fR
Run cron-driven maintenance jobs from a scheduler configuration file.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LOCO_ENV
Environment name; the package uses
.IR production .
.TP
.B LOCO_CONFIG_FOLDER
Directory containing
.IR production.yaml .
The package uses
.IR /etc/weft .
.TP
.B WEFT_APP_DIR
Directory containing
.I themes/
and
.IR assets/ .
The package uses
.IR /usr/share/weft .
.TP
.B DATABASE_URL
SQLite connection URI; the package defaults to
.IR sqlite:///var/lib/weft/weft.sqlite?mode=rwc .
.TP
.B JWT_SECRET
Secret used to sign admin session cookies.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/weft/weft.env
Generated environment file read by the systemd units.
.TP
.I /etc/weft/production.yaml
Main configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/weft
SQLite database and uploaded media.
.TP
.I /var/backups/weft
Database and media backups written by
.BR weft-backup.timer .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1),
.I /usr/share/doc/weft/deployment.md
